GET http://localhost:3000/figures 

### Get single figure 
GET http://localhost:3000/figures/6aad682b9c7f1eec0d5b0f5c

### Create a figure 
POST http://localhost:3000/figures 
Content-Type: application/json

{ 
    "name": "Test Figure", 
    "alternativeName": "Test Person", 
    "gender": "Unknown", 
    "title": "Test Title", 
    "period": "Predynastic Egypt", 
    "time": "c. 3200 BCE", 
    "description": "Test figure created through the API.", 
    "certaintyLevel": 8, 
    "sources": [] 
} 

